\par
the probability distributions derived from these mod-
\par
els with intuitively assessed probability distributions.
\par
Although their sample size is small, the results sug-
\par
gest that the mathematical methods perform some-
\par
what better than intuitive assessment, and the authors
\par
speculate that this is due to the structured nature of
\par
the assessments required in the mathematical-aggre-
\par
gation models.
