Twosimple integrated assessment frame-
\par
works have already been completed at Car-
\par
negie Mellon (10, 11). The first, ICAM-0
\par
(Integrated Climate Assessment Model,
\par
version 0) casts the problem from the per-
\par
spective ofvarious key decision-makers and
