of trends, industry forecasts, manufacturing processes,
\par
and competing products for each application or chemi-
\par
cal. Projected general economic is subtracted
\par
from POD-production rates to obtain intensity growth
\par
rates.
\par
The distribution for growth rates of regional econ-
\par
omies, applications of single chemicals within a region,
\par
and chemical use in each region, are aggregated to pro-
