\par
required. The great simplicity of probabilistic
\par
systems based on these two assumptions
\par
made the approach popular. Several medical
\par
diagnostic systems have been constructed
\par
based on the simplified probabilistic scheme
\par
(Szolovits and Pauker 1978), including sys-
\par
