\par
the decision-analytic system is shown in
\par
figure 8b.
\par
The arrows in figure 8a indicate dependen-
\par
cies in the diagnostic rules, in the direction of
\par
the flow of evidence from findings to diseases
\par
to the treatment decision. The arrows in
\par
figure 8b represent influence, coded as condi-
\par
tional probabilities, from cause to effect. For
\par
example, the diagnostic rule goes from Phy-
\par
