\par
diagnostic decision rule directly recommends
\par
treatment depending on the amount of evi-
\par
dence for the disorders, the abiotic stress, and
\par
the Phytophthora infection. Given the full
\par
diagram, Bayesian inference algorithms allow
\par
reasoning in either direction. The influence
\par
diagram contains an extra residual node,
\par
