\par
\textbf{the implicit cost of public expenditures, and the extent to which giving}
\par
\textbf{payments to those not truly disabled produces benefits that fall short of}
\par
\textbf{the cost of public funds. While this formulation does not appear to deviate}
\par
\textbf{substantially from conventional understandings, it is suggested that argu-}
\par
