\par
\textbf{Before discussing contexts in which this conclusion may not hold, it is}
\par
\textbf{useful to explore the implications of social and private incentives to ac-}
\par
\textbf{quire information being properly aligned. On one hand, alignment implies}
\par
\textbf{that there is no case for taxing or subsidizing individuals' purchases of}
\par
\textbf{such information28-which often may consist of legal services. On the}
\par
\textbf{other hand, alignment of ex ante incentives leaves open the question}
\par
\textbf{whether the degree of accuracy ex post is appropriate. The analysis of}
