\par
\textbf{B. Applications}
\par
\textbf{This section applies the analysis in Section A to various legal settings.}
\par
\textbf{Some of the applications are generic, consisting of comments on the type}
\par
\textbf{of setting or legal question to which the analysis applies. Others are}
\par
\textbf{specific and are offered because of their independent significance as well}
\par
\textbf{as their value in illustrating the analysis more concretely.}
\par
\textbf{1. Generality with Regard to Areas of Law and Types of Rules}
\par
\textbf{The scenarios outlined and analyzed in Section A are most directly}
\par
