\par
and Siegel 1995) as well as related studies on earnings forecasts and earnings
\par
announcements (e.g., Aj inkya and Gift 1984; Atiase 1985 ). One of the most
\par
important subareas of empirical studies goes under the name of "market based
\par
accounting research" (MBAR). Its preliminary results have been characterized by
\par
