\par
contractual basis of accounting valuation was examined by John Hughes (1984),
\par
the application of asymmetric information aspects to the LIFO/FIFO choice by Pat
\par
Hughes and Schwartz ( 1988\textbraceright --this and related articles also illustrate the relatively
