\par
sance. IES operates by dynamically and incrementally
\par
forming a hierarchy of IDs for image interpretation; it
\par
attempts to use visual information as a way of under-
\par
standing the movements of troops and other objects.
\par
Earlier versions of the system were known as ADRIES,
\par
and by several other acronyms.
