Pathfinder (Heckerman et al. 1992, Heckerman and
\par
Nathwani 1992a, 1992b): A medical system that di-
\par
agnoses hematopathologies, or diseases of the human
\par
lymph system. Pathfinder's designers introduced sim-
\par
ilarity networks to help elicit the information necessary
\par
