\par
Shwe et al. 1991): A large BN reformulation of the
\par
QMR-DT project. QMR (Quick Medical Reference) is a
\par
knowledge base and diagnostic aid for internal medi-
\par
cine; it is part of the Internist-1 system. QMR-DT, in
\par
