\par
Entrepreneurial resources will affect decision initiation
\par
and ratification steps because of the associated uncer-
\par
tainty. For decision initiation, creativity and alertness will
\par
facilitate the generation of novel proposals that are more
\par
likely to generate entrepreneurial outcomes. Because of
\par
the proposer's bounded rationality, only a limited number
\par
of scenarios might be evaluated and plans might be pro-
\par
posed. Intuition and foresight will enhance the effective-
\par
ness of the proposals by eliminating dead ends and not
\par
prematurely dismissing promising plans. Thus, creativity
\par
sources. As an individual proceeds with a series of de-
