that of others, one can ascertain an individual's overall
\par
ability to generate entrepreneurial outcomes, that is, the
\par
individual's entrepreneurial capability. Examining actual
\par
performance outcomes will indicate how frequent and im-
\par
portant are the entrepreneurial outcomes. However, even
