II. EVIDENTIARY DOCTRINE AND THE
\par
PRE-DAUBERT DEBATE
\par
In evidence law, the special problems of scientific evidence stem
\par
from the law's traditional approach to testimonial qualification or,
\par
as it is called by some sources, the "competency"'2 or "founda-
