\par
are fully internalized to the immediate parties. No one else can gain
\par
or lose by the factual outcome of the case.
\par
In this basic model of litigation, there is no reason to doubt the
\par
efficacy of the adversarial system for dealing with any problems of
\par
"misleading" expert testimony. If one side chooses to retain an
\par
