\par
matter of broad social import. To the extent that Daubert helps
\par
provide an antidote to that thinking, it will make a positive con-
\par
tribution to the law and economics of litigation.
\par
In operational terms, Daubert reorients admissibility doctrine
\par
more closely to what one might reasonably expect of evidence law.
