\par
that fact-finding in particular cases is not an "exhaustive search for
\par
cosmic understanding." Accordingly, Daubert instructs trial judges
\par
to apply the ordinary tools of the adversarial system to determine
\par
when to receive scientific evidence, even when that task casts
\par
