\par
the utility derived from a given level of consumption,
\par
(2) uncertainty about nonmarket warming losses is the
\par
only uncertainty, and (3) \textbf{loss }probabilities are independ-
\par
ent of the prior history of losses.
\par
The above assumptions make it possible to repre-
