\par
tainty, and the value of resolving various kinds of
\par
uncertainty.
\par
To begin with, consider the situation where uncer-
\par
tainty about the three key parameters persists through
\par
2050. Figure 3 shows the time paths of optimal emis-
\par
sions for this situation. Note that the emissions paths are
\par
the same across states of the world, during the periods
