\par
l people remain unaware of, or place low value on, environmental impacts like
\par
biodiversity loss;
\par
l of the weakening of the nation state leading to con ict and collapse of treaty
\par
obligation enforcement
\par
(ii) Decarbonization of the energy system stops because
\par
