\par
node in the therapy map. If both the value for the
\par
setting and the value of the error are known, how-
\par
ever, then the FIOs received by the patient is also
\par
known. Thus the oxygen transport node, FIO2, is
\par
deterministically assessed from the decision node
\par
and the node delivery error.
