which are a chemical species injurious to cells, par-
\par
ticularty the cells that line the lungs. The therapy
\par
map captures this side effect with the node oxygen
\par
toxicity. Individual variability in the development
\par
of oxygen toxicity is parameterized by the node Sus-
\par
ceptibility.
