\par
vations valid during the time period of the forecast
\par
verification to simulate the numerical modeling data
\par
that was available to the forecaster. Although this pro-
\par
cedure may produce data that is more accurate than
\par
the data available to the forecasters, it is tenable pro-
\par
vided that we restrict our analyses to periods up to
\par
