\par
pare favorably to the measurement errors involved in
\par
direct measurement of atmospheric characteristics (Di-
\par
Mego \textbf{\emph{et }}\emph{al., }1992). \textbf{A }detailed description of the method
\par
for estimating the cues is available from the authors.
