\par
Goal: Is the IS economically rational?
\par
Level of analysis: efficiency \& effectiveness
\par
Language: Quantitative
\par
Examples: cost-benefit analysis, decision \& utility
\par
analysis,microe\textasciitilde onomic production theory
\par
(Mukhopadhyay, 1989) data envelope
\par
analysis (Kauffman and Kriebel, 1988)
