\par
Richard S.J. Tol
\par
Institute for Environmental Studies, Vrije Universiteit, Amsterdam, The Netherlands
\par
Center for Integrated Study of the Human Dimensions of Global Change, Department of Engineering and Public Policy, Carnegie Mellon University,
\par
