\par
aspect of the climate system: Climate Sensitivity and Ocean
\par
Diffusivity. Climate sensitivity represents the response of
\par
the atmospheric system to radiative forcing, assuming the
\par
system is in equilibrium with the ocean. Ocean diffusiv-
\par
