\par
sponse is stated in terms of the familiar definition of climate
\par
sensitivity, which is the equilibrium response to doubled
\par
CO2 concentration. The ocean model now implemented in
\par
the IGSM contains a diffusion approximation of deep ocean
\par
circulations, and the parameter tested here is the key one
\par
determining their strength.
