\par
having treated abatement costs as certain, when in fact they
\par
are not. Recall that each of the sixteen sequential climate
\par
policies considered here is characterized by a pair of abate-
\par
ment costs (obtained from the MIT EPPA model), one for
\par
each of the two periods in the model. We analyze the sen-
\par
