\par
\textbf{3.1. The Life-duration Experiment}
\par
\textbf{Subjects. The object of the first experiment was to}
\par
\textbf{elicit the utility of life duration from 54 subjects. Fifteen}
\par
\textbf{of them were Ph.D. students in economics who were at}
\par
\textbf{the beginning of a decision theory course in Copenha-}
\par
\textbf{gen; 15 subjects were undergraduate students in psy-}
\par
\textbf{chology at the University of Leiden who were enrolled}
\par
\textbf{in a cognition course; and, finally, 24 subjects were med-}
\par
\textbf{ical residents at the University of Leiden who were en-}
\par
